Package: trama.python
Title: Python (scikit-learn) Models for trama - Proof of Concept
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "Mambelli Fernandes", , "pedromambelli@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Proof of concept of a trama collection whose nodes run Python
    through 'reticulate'. Fits are 'models/fit' objects that implement the
    'trama.models' contract, so the R readers (predict, evaluate, ROC,
    importance) work on them unchanged. The core package is not touched.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    trama (>= 0.3.1),
    trama.data,
    trama.models,
    reticulate (>= 1.41),
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    pkgload,
    mirai
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/trama/requires: trama.data, trama.view, trama.models
